# Offline base-map label assets (v0.5.45): glyph protobufs + sprite PNGs are
# binary. Mark them so no machine (notably Windows CI, where core.autocrlf
# defaults to true) ever EOL-normalizes them — a CRLF injection into a .pbf
# (every glyph pbf begins with byte 0x0a / LF) corrupts it and silently blanks
# offline labels. The sprite *.json files are genuine JSON and stay text.
frontend/public/mapassets/**/*.pbf binary
frontend/public/mapassets/**/*.png binary
